sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Tomcat request thread
  participant L as AiRateLimiter
  participant B as AiCircuitBreaker
  participant Q as ThreadPoolExecutor 4 workers, queue 16
  participant W as ai-provider worker
  participant P as AiProvider
  T->>L: check(tenant)
  L-->>T: ok or RateLimitedException 429
  T->>B: allow()
  B-->>T: false means degraded response
  T->>Q: submit(analyze)
  Q-->>T: RejectedExecutionException means overloaded
  Q->>W: run
  W->>P: analyze(sanitised request)
  T->>T: future.get(timeout)
  P-->>W: result
  W-->>T: result or ExecutionException
  T->>T: timeout then cancel(true), retry with backoff inside total deadline
  T->>B: success() or failure()
